{"detail": {"templateUuid": "8ad216d218f04758b6224936ba680f7e", "projectUuid": "f1f3f68d38fa4ec195baef99ae7381d8", "name": "奉天靖难丨朱墙古松中式宫阙美学", "description": "这次AIGC美学探索，没有把中国宫阙塑造成遥远的仙境，而是将它置于王朝秩序即将崩塌的瞬间：冷青色风雨压住天幕，朱红烈焰吞没重檐，渺小人物与庞大宫城形成极端的尺度反差。\n我想呈现的不是一幅静止的历史插图，而是一部AI重构的中国历史电影——宫阙有重量，火光有呼吸，沉默之中，藏着山河易主前的最后一秒。", "coverUrl": "/assets/690ded811ba429b2.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/4516157ad4cf4175bef2cb448d41b9f3/ccaaaa73618099cd42c2d3ef35847c333bb3d3a8.mp4", "snapshotId": 44251, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 1740662, "ownerUuid": "4516157ad4cf4175bef2cb448d41b9f3", "avatar": "/assets/40702f645561be10.webp", "nickname": "三千问Atelier", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 37, "tags": [{"id": 3057, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "一场戏的诞生 ", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3059, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "2. 消失的TA", "parentTag": 3057, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/3059", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1202, "code": "style_aesthetic", "tagLabel": "风格美学", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1202/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 2, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "14 【奉天靖难-AIGC中国宫阙美学风格 - 三千问Atelier-美学分享 | 小红书 - 你的生活兴趣社区】 😆 Zz75bZYTsHAzGkQ 😆 https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6a9b27d6000000001001fb1b?source=webshare&xhsshare=pc_web&xsec_token=ABoR-b3_M_QHFDDvnPZ5ptLaokrhI2Tp2HCXq9DALuGWI=&xsec_source=pc_share", "createAt": "2026年09月08日 01:58", "updateAt": "2026年09月08日 02:22", "publ